# ===== 仓库安全白名单 =====
# 默认全部忽略，仅放行自研源码/测试/文档/清单
/*

# 放行目录
!df02/
!integration/
!integration_v1.0.1/
!reports/
!docs/

# 全局忽略：任何二进制/游戏资产/日志/凭证
*.pack
*.pack.bak
*.save
*.esf
*.bin
*.dat
*.log
*.tsv
*.json.bak
_secret*
*secret*
*credential*
*token*
*apikey*
*api_key*
_evidence/
evidence/
logs/
build/
_baseline/
backup/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
_copy_index.json
_sync_index.json

# 放行自研文本文件
!**/*.lua
!**/*.py
!**/*.md
!**/SHA256_MANIFEST.txt
!README.md
!.gitignore

# 双保险：即使被放行规则覆盖，也永不入库
**/*.pack
**/*.save
**/*.log
